          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Praise the LORD, for it is good to sing praises to our God; for it is pleasant and fitting to praise him.",
      "ko": "할렐루야 우리 하나님께 찬양함이 선함이여 찬송함이 아름답고 마땅하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8761f9eb4110fbd6cc6d449ca82aca170bcdfc1708404c175dc40bbfff786ec8",
      "translation_text_hash": "f094aa624370e8be8ba894b1437a3d369ff7a30720d3d9f5b61039612d04be30",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "할렐루야 우리 하나님께 찬양함이 선함이여 찬송함이 아름답고 마땅하도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f094aa624370e8be8ba894b1437a3d369ff7a30720d3d9f5b61039612d04be30"
      ]
    },
    {
