      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "He heals the broken in heart, and binds up their wounds.",
      "ko": "상심한 자를 고치시며 저희 상처를 싸매시는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "5a5040bcb08e06ec5f49d5fba744ff5bb7964922546263f498b3ed21a3b71592",
      "translation_text_hash": "aaa3eacfb11dba3fced8ffa87d1ec266b6dae40b39c40ae3072979845ffc3772",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "상심한 자를 고치시며 저희 상처를 싸매시는도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "aaa3eacfb11dba3fced8ffa87d1ec266b6dae40b39c40ae3072979845ffc3772"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:147:4",
      "sequence": 16356,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 147",
      "verse_label": "4",
