        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "Praise the LORD, Jerusalem! Praise your God, Zion!",
      "ko": "예루살렘아 여호와를 찬송할찌어다 시온아 네 하나님을 찬양할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "dd4f489ce19675529a93ecd18f664457fc3afed80cf52744ddc063384bb09c13",
      "translation_text_hash": "b28ee46b49490b432aadc7b31a5f73785b2cf42f559e936e68df13249fa41bb4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "예루살렘아 여호와를 찬송할찌어다 시온아 네 하나님을 찬양할찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b28ee46b49490b432aadc7b31a5f73785b2cf42f559e936e68df13249fa41bb4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:147:13",
      "sequence": 16365,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 147",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
        "chapter": 147,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "For he has strengthened the bars of your gates. He has blessed your children within you.",
      "ko": "저가 네 문빗장을 견고히 하시고 너의 가운데 자녀에게 복을 주셨으며",
      "source_text_hash": "6778e19a9b5015f5a81082f4d224f38e7765730d454023c2412642563a2d00e0",
      "translation_text_hash": "28cba5e21c48abb5094769273d8ae346e5188cc399bec6d154defa626b1339f6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 네 문빗장을 견고히 하시고 너의 가운데 자녀에게 복을 주셨으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "28cba5e21c48abb5094769273d8ae346e5188cc399bec6d154defa626b1339f6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:147:14",
      "sequence": 16366,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 147",
      "verse_label": "14",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
        "chapter": 147,
        "verse": 14
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "He makes peace in your borders. He fills you with the finest of the wheat.",
      "ko": "네 경내를 평안케 하시고 아름다운 밀로 너를 배불리시며",
      "source_text_hash": "905905efec941449516f0ec3ba801a03be138dd2359ef149d7fec392147dfb44",
      "translation_text_hash": "fa444f01bd8e90b266cb0661348de6b5bda463685e46d32df703d3952bb0788f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 경내를 평안케 하시고 아름다운 밀로 너를 배불리시며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "fa444f01bd8e90b266cb0661348de6b5bda463685e46d32df703d3952bb0788f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:147:15",
      "sequence": 16367,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 147",
      "verse_label": "15",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
        "chapter": 147,
        "verse": 15
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "He sends out his commandment to the earth. His word runs very swiftly.",
      "ko": "그 명을 땅에 보내시니 그 말씀이 속히 달리는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8c9cc9e0d607f4506fe16f5d3f43ad72fbcbd8d8f8c6171478748c0959851797",
      "translation_text_hash": "64737a379c2ce6aa108aa02105c386e67cbe906974ef920696935c4f01422d2a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 명을 땅에 보내시니 그 말씀이 속히 달리는도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "64737a379c2ce6aa108aa02105c386e67cbe906974ef920696935c4f01422d2a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:147:16",
      "sequence": 16368,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 147",
      "verse_label": "16",
      "locator": {
        "book": "PSA",
        "chapter": 147,
        "verse": 16
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 147,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "He gives snow like wool, and scatters frost like ashes.",
